# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of a
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Working-tree endings still follow each
# developer's local config, so Windows checkouts are unaffected.
#
# Added after PR #17, where src/app/globals.css — the only source file that had
# been committed with CRLF — was converted to LF and showed up as a 7,385-line
# rewrite, burying ~15 lines of real change.
* text=auto

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
